{"type":"message","id":"06e4ce46","parentId":"1d606719","timestamp":"2026-04-12T22:00:44.985Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_5185f65d195342fe8ce4da6a","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-04-13 (월)\n\n## Cron Health\n- **CRITICAL:** daily-github-backup push failed (403 error)\n- Local commit successful (46 files changed, 3736 insertions)\n- Commit ID: 372320ee\n- Error: Permission denied to NousResearch/hermes-agent.git for Lfantasial\n- Root cause: Lfantasial account lacks push permissions to NousResearch/hermes-agent.git\n- Other cron jobs: healthy\n\n## System Status\n- Gateway restart ok (npm)\n- OpenClaw: Up to date (2026.4.11 stable)\n- Skills: All up to date\n- Update check: No updates available\n\n## Heartbeat Notes\n- Day rollover to 2026-04-13\n- GitHub backup push failure at 04:00 KST\n- Local backup successful, remote push failed\n- Error persists (no status change since 04:29 KST)\n- Update check completed at 06:00 KST\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776031244979}}
